    <h2 class="lp-cta__heading">Start your club<br>on GatherBound</h2>
    <p class="lp-cta__text">We're onboarding a small group of book clubs for our private beta. Tell us about your club and we'll get you set up.</p>
    <div class="lp-cta__form">
      <iframe data-tally-src="https://tally.so/embed/vG2BJg?alignLeft=1&hideTitle=1&transparentBackground=1&dynamicHeight=1" loading="lazy" width="100%" frameborder="0" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" title="GatherBound Waitlist"></iframe>
      <script>var d=document,w="https://tally.so/widgets/embed.js",v=function(){"undefined"!=typeof Tally?Tally.loadEmbeds():d.querySelectorAll("iframe[data-tally-src]:not([src])").forEach((function(e){e.src=e.dataset.tallySrc}))};if("undefined"!=typeof Tally)v();else if(d.querySelector('script[src="'+w+'"]')==null){var s=d.createElement("script");s.src=w,s.onload=v,s.onerror=v,d.body.appendChild(s)}else v();</script>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-cta__note">No credit card required. Free during beta.</p>
  </div>
</section>
